2. Rows 1–5 hold three UI boxes (cols 1–3, 5–7, 9–11). On the first action they flash: box1 `g`→`b`, box2 `g`→`w`, box3 `b`→`w`, plus (2,6) and (2,10) `W`→`w`, and row 5 mirrors (cols 1–3 `W`→`b`, cols 9–11 `b`→`W`).

